  "description": "Noah Brown has a gift for fighting. Unfortunately, punching things doesn't pay his bills. \nAt least, that was the case until he dies and an Eldritch god finds his soul. \nThe strange encounter brings him to a new world, summoned by bloody cultists. \nHe’s got nothing but the shirt on his back and a strange item of unknown power he isn’t yet sure how to use. \nIf he wants to survive, maybe even thrive, perhaps it's time he finally put his gift to good use.\n\n**Official Translations:**   \n[English](https://www.webtoons.com/en/action/rise-of-the-devourer/list?title_no=7818)",
